										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>This week&#8217;s <em>Bespoke Report</em> is an updated version of our &#8220;Pros and Cons&#8221; edition for Q4 2026.</p>
<p>With this report, you’re able to get a complete picture of the bull and bear case for US stocks right now.  It’s heavy on graphics and light on text, but we let the charts and tables do the talking.</p>
<p>On page three of the report, you’ll see a full list of the pros and cons that we lay out.  Slides for each topic are then provided on page four and beyond.</p>
<p><a href="https://www.bespokepremium.com/bespoke-member-plans/"><img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-212730" src="https://media.bespokepremium.com/uploads/2026/10/brthumb100226.png" alt="" width="627" height="472" srcset="https://media.bespokepremium.com/uploads/2026/10/brthumb100226-300x226.png 300w, https://media.bespokepremium.com/uploads/2026/10/brthumb100226-480x361.png 480w, https://media.bespokepremium.com/uploads/2026/10/brthumb100226.png 627w" sizes="(max-width: 627px) 100vw, 627px" /></a></p>
<p>To read this report and access everything else Bespoke&#8217;s research platform has to offer, <b><a href="https://www.bespokepremium.com/bespoke-member-plans/">start a trial</a> to any of our three membership levels today!</b></p>
